    "question": "T\u00f3m t\u1eaft n\u1ed9i dung ch\u00ednh v\u00e0 \u0111\u00f3ng g\u00f3p c\u1ee7a nghi\u00ean c\u1ee9u 'Agentic Retrieval-Augmented Generation for Knowledge-Intensive Tasks' l\u00e0 g\u00ec?",
